  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Phew...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I probably won't be found if I hide here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "But, I won't be able to go back to those kids anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I hope nothing happens to them...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "*sigh*... Why...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Who is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Are you Miss Misha?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I'm sorry, Miss Misha. I hope I didn't scare you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "These are my coleagues, Franka and Liskarm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Hey there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Good day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We're from Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals. As an organization made to serve the Infected, at least...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We hope to be able to help you. That's why we'd like to talk for a bit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Talk?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Mhm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This isn't the best place for that though...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "As of right now, our top priority is keeping you safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "For the time being, we'll protect you, so rest assured.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What... are you talking about...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "You're just going to capture me and lock me up, aren't you? !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Get away from me! My claws are sharp...! If you don't want to get hurt...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "...Pfft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What are you laughing about...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "If we really were going to capture you, we wouldn't have given you a chance to resist.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Miss Misha, we really do want to help you, so...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "I don't trust you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Lungmen treats the Infected worse than they treat criminals!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Why would you... Why would you go out of your way to help the Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "--Miss Misha, look...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What... are you doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Your...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Your hand...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "You're also... an Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "That's right, I'm just like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "There are a lot of Infected in these slums. Those kids you left behind just now... they trusted you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Misha, you've already put them in danger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Are you going to use those kids to threaten me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "No, I wouldn't. But someone has already started doing exactly that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We just chased off a group of thugs that was trying to threaten those kids.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Lungmen is also currently searching for the Infected. If Lungmen found you first, it might've already been too late.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We wanted to divert the rioters from those kids by drawing their attention to you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Looking at it from another perspective, we'd also be able to keep you safe from harm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Do you know why they're after me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "What reason do you have... to do all this for me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We actually don't know why there are Infected targeting you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But we do care about the safety of innocents, including you. At least, this is the best course of action for the time being. I hope that you'll be able to trust us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Would you allow us to take you from here first?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "...Fine... Let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "After all, I don't really have a choice, do I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I wouldn't say that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But at least, thank you... Miss Misha!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
